# Decadent Dragon ({2}{R}{R}, 4/4 flying, trample): "Whenever this creature attacks, create a Treasure token." Expensive Taste's only
# target is an opponent (CR 115.1: a spell's own controller is no legal target), so aiming it at Bot1 is refused. Cast as the
# Adventure it goes to exile (CR 715.4), from where only the creature may be cast later (CR 715.3d): four Mox Rubies pay for it on
# turn 3. On turn 5 it attacks: the Treasure token arrives, the Dragon's flyer cannot be blocked by Bot2's ground Memnite, and
# Bot2 takes 4.

